Z||000006||Monkeyman||10-26-2001||09:32 PM||||It's currently 8:30pm in Indiana.  Tomorrow night at this time, it will still be 8:30pm.  Six months from now, it will still be 8:30pm.  I don't know how you guys (and gals) remember all of the time change stuff.  BTW--This is the 1st year in the last 20 or so that the Indiana Legislature hasn't had a time change bill on the books.  It's about time (no pun intended  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ).||||reg||1
